    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's honestly terrifying when you realize how deep it goes. i need to make sure my studio doesn't become a dead zone for my creativity. if these frequencies are being used to dampen neuro-divergent patterns, what kind of equipment or specific shielding materials should i be looking for to create a safe, protected space where these waves can't reach? i want to make sure my work remains uncompromised.",
